        "attribution": "The named scientists represent key theoretical and accelerator-physics contributions to the enabling FEL concept and realization.",
        "maturity": "Multiple facilities operate reliably and have produced a large, independent scientific record.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "Large facilities involve many indispensable contributors, making a three-person attribution difficult."
