        "attribution": "Bistritzer and MacDonald established the key theoretical mechanism, and Jarillo-Herrero led the landmark experiments.",
        "maturity": "The discovery has generated a vigorous, reproducible research field across many moiré materials.",
        "uncertainties": [
          "A complete microscopic account of the correlated phases remains unsettled."
